  Note over OB,Alice: Book: Alice's ask 4 NTU @ 2.0 (order 1)
  Bob->>Q: approve(OrderBook, 22)
  Note right of Bob: 22 = requiredQuote(10, 2.2)
  Bob->>OB: placeLimitOrder(Buy, 2.2, 10)
  activate OB
