  OB->>Q: transferFrom(Bob, OrderBook, 22): escrow pull
  Note over Q,N: emit OrderPlaced(2, Bob, Buy, 2.2, 10)
  loop _matchTaker, at most 10 fills
    Note over Q,N: _settleFill(maker 1, taker 2, qty 4) at maker price 2.0<br/>state first: lockedQuote = ceil(6 x 2.2) = 13.2,<br/>ask 1 Filled and unlinked, lastTradePrice = 2.0<br/>emit Trade(1, 2, Alice, Bob, 2.0, 4, 8)
    OB->>N: 4 NTU to Bob
    OB->>Q: 8 SGDx to Alice
    OB->>Q: refund 0.8 SGDx to Bob
    Note right of N: refund = 22 - 8 - 13.2
  end
  Note over Q,N: no ask left: loop ends<br/>remainder rests: _insert(order 2), 6 NTU @ 2.2<br/>PartiallyFilled, lockedQuote 13.2
  deactivate OB
